      "ppv:wentWell": "Completed the architecture review for the new microservice. Got positive feedback on the technical design doc from the senior staff engineer.",
      "ppv:needsAttention": "Didn't make progress on the conference abstract. Need to block dedicated time for writing instead of letting meetings fill the calendar.",
